<title>UK: Racal wins 50 mln stg defence orders.</title>
<headline>Racal wins 50 mln stg defence orders.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>British specialist electronics group Racal Electronics Plc said on Thursday it had won 50 million stg of defence systems orders.</p>
<p>Racal said the systems, including radio communications and navigation equipment, would be supplied to Britain's Ministry of Defence, the Romanian Ministry of National Defence and to customers in the Middle East, among others.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
